  m_text: "Khi ch\u1ECDn T\u1EA5n C\xF4ng ho\u1EB7c K\u1EF9 N\u0103ng, h\xE3y tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi c\xE2u h\u1ECFi Ti\u1EBFng Anh (CEFR B1\u2013B2: Grammar, Vocab, Phrasal Verbs, Conditionals...).\n\u2022 \u0110\xDANG: Xu\u1EA5t chi\xEAu + th\u01B0\u1EDFng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng & +10 V\xE0ng (Chu\u1ED7i >= 3 t\u0103ng +20% l\u1EF1c \u0111\xE1nh!).\n\u2022 SAI: Anh h\xF9ng m\u1EA5t l\u01B0\u1EE3t."
